// A short Yarn Spinner script for the import sample. Convert it with
// "Import Yarn" in the Story tab, or see tests/unit/talescript/test_yarn_converter.gd.
title: Start
tags: intro
position: 0,0
---
<<declare $lamps_lit = 0>>
<<declare $has_key = false>>
The lighthouse door is open. Wind pulls at your coat. #line:lh_start_1
Keeper: You came up the long stairs for something. What is it? #line:lh_start_2
-> Ask about the lamp. #line:lh_opt_lamp
    Keeper: It has not been lit in a year. #line:lh_lamp_1
    <<set $lamps_lit to $lamps_lit + 1>>
    <<jump Lamp>>
-> Ask about the key. <<if $has_key is false>> #line:lh_opt_key
    Keeper: Here. Don't lose it. #line:lh_key_1
    <<set $has_key to true>>
    <<jump Start>>
-> Leave. #line:lh_opt_leave
    <<jump Shore>>
===
title: Lamp
---
<<wait 0.5>>
<<if $has_key and $lamps_lit >= 1>>
    You turn the key, and the lamp flares to life. #line:lh_lamp_lit
<<elseif $lamps_lit > 3>>
    Keeper: Stop pacing and fetch the key. #line:lh_lamp_pace
<<else>>
    The lamp stays dark. Lamps lit so far: {$lamps_lit}. #line:lh_lamp_dark
<<endif>>
<<fade_out 1>>
<<jump Shore>>
===
title: Shore
---
<<if visited("Lamp")>>
    Keeper: Thank you for climbing up. #line:lh_shore_thanks
<<endif>>
The waves keep their own time. #line:lh_shore_end
===
